## 📊 Summary of Benchmark Results

| Model Architecture | Multi-Class Support | F1 Score | False Positive Rate | Temporal Rollout |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Logistic Regression (Baseline)** | No (Binary) | 0.54 | 41.2% | None |
| **Temporal Transformer (World Model)** | Yes (6 Classes) | **0.85** | **16.7%** | $K=5$ Steps Functional |
| **Live Adversarial Detection Test** | Yes (6 Classes) | **83.3% Accuracy** | — | Real-Time Container Traffic |

