## 🛠️ Key File Deliverables

- `src/model/world_model_multiclass.py` — Multi-class Temporal Transformer with MITRE mapping.
- `src/adversarial/training_loop.py` — Automated Docker adversarial training loop.
- `src/adversarial/attacker_bot.py` & `attack_script.py` — Attacker bot with evasion strategies.
- `src/adversarial/traffic_capture.py` — Real-time container tcpdump capture module.
- `scripts/fetch_mitre_attack.py` — Official MITRE CTI downloader.
- `data/mitre_attack.json` — 222 Enterprise MITRE ATT&CK techniques with threat actor examples.
- `configs/default.yaml` & `requirements.txt` — Project configuration and isolated venv deps.
- `README.md` — Full project documentation, visual UI design spec, and roadmap.
